==Description==
The '''NullAndVoid Nametag''' is a nametag obtained from the badge Triumph All Nights badge, which was gotten by triumphing all [[Null & Void Event]] nights on the Hard difficulty in a row, without losing or restarting. The continue button had to be used to play the next night. It has to be claimed through the [[Gift Box]] in the top right corner of the screen.

The '''NullAndVoid Nametag''' has an orange to purple gradient text with a translucent outline. Purple smoke and yellow sparkles appear behind the text. It has white teeth under and above the text, which have a bat wing on each side. On top of the upper teeth, there is a giant eye and purple flames.

